                "texts": {
                        "name": "Alma",
                        "biography": "Ever since she was a little girl, Alma believed that every creature, no matter how small or terrifying, deserved to be loved, for they all belong to a family. Her gentle touch and innate healing magic allowed her to form bonds with beasts others would kill on sight. Through unconditional compassion, she managed to tame even the most ferocious leviathans of the deep. Now, the fearsome Sea Serpents willingly swim alongside her ship, fiercely protecting the one navigator who treats them not as monsters, but as kin.",
                        "specialty": {
                                "name": "Sea Serpents",
                                "tooltip": "Creature Bonus: Sea Serpents",
                                "description": "Increases the Speed of any Sea Serpents or Haspids by 1 and their Attack and Defense skills by 20% for every 7 levels (rounded up)."
                        }
                }
        },
